========================================
MEDIUM-01: Webflow CMS Version and Infrastructure Disclosure
========================================
Severity: MEDIUM
CVSS 4.0: 4.3 (AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N)
CVSS 3.1: 4.3 (AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:N)

Description:
The Cronometer main site is built on Webflow and discloses detailed version and infrastructure information:
- Webflow generator meta tag
- Specific CSS/JS bundle versions with timestamps (wf-2026-11-10)
- CDN hostnames (cdn1.cronometer.com)
- jQuery version (3.6.1)
- WebFont loader version (1.6.26)
- Exact publish timestamp: "Tue Nov 10 2026 15:48:37 GMT+0000"

Evidence:
<!-- This site was created in Webflow. https://webflow.com -->
<!-- Last Published: Tue Nov 10 2026 15:48:37 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time) -->
<meta content="Webflow" name="generator"/>
<link crossorigin="anonymous" href="https://cdn1.cronometer.com/wf-2026-11-10/css/normalize.css" integrity="sha384-g8ZrgtGrurwEE71iw4bX79r9b89jqV0W1yq9aL7do4QZvDb2cePl041sgOngQ2eX" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css"/>
<link crossorigin="anonymous" href="https://cdn1.cronometer.com/wf-2026-11-10/css/webflow.css" integrity="sha384-VEC/+6E+FnsB04g6lTAQh1dreAXBKGep9klHqRaBOgHIRSqLGt7QuvDn+R1AFHEZ" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css"/>
<link crossorigin="anonymous" href="https://cdn1.cronometer.com/wf-2026-11-10/css/cronometer-landing-8e074c-19666c275ff09.webflow.css" integrity="sha384-nN3Pi63b6VROAhyliTM8d/k+AHcieCsjKRkUaA8yzR4XdQUXVHwkJpxyDTUS+P0F" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/webfont/1.6.26/webfont.js" type="text/javascript">
<script crossorigin="anonymous" integrity="sha384-i61gTtaoovXtAbKjo903+O55Jkn2+RtzHtvNez+yI49HAASvznhe9sZyjaSHTau9" src="/js/jquery-3.6.1.min.js" type="text/javascript">

Impact:
- Webflow version tracking for targeted exploits
- CDN infrastructure mapping (cdn1.cronometer.com)
- Dependency version disclosure (jQuery 3.6.1, WebFont 1.6.26)
- Publish timeline reveals deployment schedule
- Subresource Integrity hashes allow verification but also fingerprinting

Remediation:
- Remove generator meta tag
- Obfuscate or remove publish timestamps
- Use generic CDN paths without date-based versioning
- Consider removing SRI hashes from public HTML or using dynamic integrity

